    "# NSSC 2026 \u2014 Data Analytics\n",
    "# Unsupervised anomaly detection in Mars HiRISE orbital imagery\n",
    "\n",
    "End-to-end pipeline: convolutional autoencoder trained from scratch (no pretrained weights),\n",
    "Isolation Forest on the learned latents, an extreme-value threshold on the novelty scores,\n",
    "and per-pixel reconstruction-error interpretability for the flagged crops.\n",
    "\n",
    "Expected layout before running:\n",
    "\n",
    "```\n",
    "data/\n",
    "  map-proj-v3/                    # ~10k grayscale 227x227 crops (all labels stripped)\n",
    "  source_image_metadata.csv       # source_image_id, latitude, longitude, sun_angle, season, resolution\n",
    "  crop_map.csv                    # OPTIONAL: columns file,source_image_id (used if filenames do not encode the source ID)\n",
    "artifacts/                        # created automatically: weights, latents, scores, figures\n",
    "```\n",
    "\n",
    "Run order: Section 0 (setup) -> Phase 1 -> Phase 2 -> Phase 3 -> Phase 4.\n",
    "Every section heading names the sub-question it answers."
   ]
  },
