    "The metadata block is encoded as sine and cosine of the sun angle, one-hot season, and\n",
    "standardised log resolution, then scaled so its total variance is 10 percent of the image\n",
    "block's. Without that scaling the handful of metadata coordinates would be sampled by the trees\n",
    "as often as the image coordinates and would dominate isolation depth. The image-only pipeline\n",
    "above remains the primary result; this section reports how the flagged set moves."
