    "Diagnosis. Two separate faults. The MSE objective is minimised by predicting the local mean on\n",
    "stochastic textures, so high-frequency terrain was discarded. And with the fine structure gone,\n",
    "the leading latent directions encoded little beyond first-order intensity statistics, so the\n",
    "forest was ranking brightness rather than novelty.\n",
